# Keeps Docker build contexts small — every app Dockerfile builds from the
# monorepo root context (see each Dockerfile's header comment), so this file
# applies to all of them.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
**/.vite

.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Legacy pre-monorepo scaffold (see docker-compose.legacy.yml) — never part
# of an apps/* image build.
backend
frontend
docker-compose.legacy.yml

*.md
!README.md
docs
ARCHITECTURE_AUDIT_AND_REDESIGN.md

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.DS_Store
*.log
